<%- include('header') %><p><a href="/prospects/<%= p.id %>/project-quotes?quote=<%= q.id %>">Back to opportunity quote</a></p><h1>The IT Guys — <%= input.basis==='fixed'?'Project quote':'Work estimate' %></h1><p><%= q.quote_number||q.id %> · <%= q.status %> · <%= p.business_name %></p>
<% if(q.status==='Draft'){ %><p class="hold">DRAFT — NOT APPROVED FOR CUSTOMER USE</p><% } %><p><%= input.scope %></p><table><thead><tr><th>Description</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Unit price</th><th>Billing</th><th>Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const l of lines){ %><tr><td><%= l.label %></td><td><%= l.quantity %></td><td>$<%= Number(l.unitPrice??l.amount).toFixed(2) %></td><td><%= l.billing %></td><td>$<%= Number(l.amount).toFixed(2) %></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table><p>One-time estimate / quote: $<%= calculation.oneTimeTotal.toFixed(2) %></p><% if(calculation.monthlyTotal){ %><p>Explicit optional monthly charges: $<%= calculation.monthlyTotal.toFixed(2) %></p><% } %><h2>Exclusions</h2><p><%= input.exclusions||'None entered' %></p><h2>Assumptions</h2><p><%= input.assumptions||'None entered' %></p><h2>Terms for this scope</h2><p><%= input.terms %></p><p>This quote/estimate is not an invoice. Customer authorization is recorded separately. Project/hourly work does not include ongoing managed support, monitoring, security or backup obligations.</p><%- include('footer') %>
